      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      290.21,
      401.87,
      314.87
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Carriage by Air(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      326.81,
      401.88,
      377.99
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 5 of the Carriage by Air Act, No. 29 of 2018is hereby amended by the insertion immediately aftersubsection (2) of that section, of the following newsubsections:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      390.05,
      401.9,
      441.23
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(3) The Minister may, from time to time by Orderpublished in the Gazette, specify the limits of liabilityas may be applicable to carriage by air not beinginternational carriage by air.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      452.33,
      401.9,
      476.03
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
